{"title":"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Compute the number of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit base-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> positive integer multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> that are also divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when read in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> instead of base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the number be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/d/c5d6cf4e9d072fbeba4fb13dffe63fa9ca820854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{abc}$\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/2/ef27ba2019c350ad38605a4dac29e9cf5b8d6a2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 | 25a + 5b + c, 100a + 10b + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"234\" height=\"18\" />, and so it must divide their difference, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/d/e9d40ee93c7b29dcc0a0417a283c51912d786e9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 | 75a + 5b \\Longrightarrow 7|-2(a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"218\" height=\"18\" />, from which it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/8/1281c9955e5e3e5b91bd0c5738d8698d7f0f1096.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7|a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" />. However, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/0/710ffd671fdcbd7ed0c0ead451f31461d326e08a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b &lt; 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1fa3ad47b62333c5fd8383187c920322d2ee24fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{a,b\\} = \\{3,4\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" />, leading to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/e/b5e8656291085c388b48a0fa8da85aed21c483bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /> solutions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/0/7808bc75038d537eede8f631cb25f9162dab9f4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$343, 434$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1\">2008 Mock ARML 1</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=206547\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017062815\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 126/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 987/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 70/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2495/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.168      1 Template:Mock_ARML_box\n100.00%    8.168      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6945:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017062815 and revision id 26192. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}